# Purpose
# Check local dependencies and install the Ruby bundle used by GitHub Pages.
#
# Common usage
# Run from the repository root.
# .\scripts\setup-pages.ps1
# .\scripts\setup-pages.ps1 -BundlePath vendor/bundle
#
# Useful options
# -BundlePath chooses where Bundler installs gems.
#
# Recommended next command
# .\scripts\build-pages.ps1 -SkipSetup
#
# Notes
# The default bundle path is ignored by git.
# Reopen PowerShell after installing Ruby or Python.
